<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 17.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 17.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:    April 17    April 16   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  271.680     271.270     247.020    9.98 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.440     307.370     306.830    0.20 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.210     157.380     158.970   -1.11 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.742	46.804	47.182   -0.93 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  442.400     440.200     419.180    5.54 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.925     140.030     141.685   -1.24 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.962	15.981	16.185   -1.38 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.670     215.830     212.430    1.53 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.866	 1.868	 1.888   -1.17 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.569	 1.571	 1.581   -0.76 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  184.615     185.160     183.135    0.81 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
